{"id":2186,"name":"紫菜蛋花汤","image":"/images/dishes/htc-2186.jpg","category":"汤粥","taste":"清淡","cookingMethod":"炖煮","difficulty":"简单","cookingTime":"15分钟","servings":"按照 1 人份的份量：","ingredients":["干紫菜","鸡蛋","小葱","虾皮（可选）","盐","香油","清水"],"preparation":["干紫菜 8g","鸡蛋 2个","小葱 1根（约5g）","虾皮 5g（可选）","盐 3g","香油 2ml","清水 700ml"],"steps":["紫菜用清水快速漂洗并沥干；鸡蛋打散，小葱切葱花。","锅中加入清水和虾皮，大火烧开。","放入紫菜，用筷子拨散，重新煮开后加入盐。","保持汤面微沸，将蛋液细细淋入锅中，停 10 秒后用汤勺轻推形成蛋花。","再煮 30 秒后关火，淋入香油并撒葱花即可。"],"nutrition":{"calories":"217 大卡"},"videoTutorials":{"platforms":[{"key":"bilibili","name":"哔哩哔哩","searchUrl":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=%E7%B4%AB%E8%8F%9C%E8%9B%8B%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%A4%20%E5%AE%B6%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%20%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B"},{"key":"douyin","name":"抖音","searchUrl":"https://www.douyin.com/search/%E7%B4%AB%E8%8F%9C%E8%9B%8B%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%A4%20%E5%AE%B6%E5%B8%B8%E5%81%9A%E6%B3%95%20%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B?type=video"}]},"source":{"name":"HowToCook","repository":"Anduin2017/HowToCook","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/c694a5c457d45e6e012ae6cd9a7724aab86e320b/dishes/soup/%E7%B4%AB%E8%8F%9C%E8%9B%8B%E8%8A%B1%E6%B1%A4.md","imageSource":{"author":"Ralff Nestor Nacor","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Egg%20Drop%20Soup%20(%E8%9B%8B%E8%8A%B1%E6%B9%AF%EF%BC%89.jpg"}}}
